      "side": 1,
      "message": "Your repro does have two pushes overlapping on the server: Ctrl+C doesn\u0027t stop the server side, so the first push is still in ChangeIndexer (the sleep) when the second one looks up the Change-Id. PS3 holds the lookup lock until the new change is indexed; pushOfChangeWaitsUntilChangeCreatedByConcurrentPushIsIndexed reproduces your scenario. For the case without any overlap, where the indexing was skipped because the push was cancelled or failed, the push now checks the index before releasing its locks and indexes any new change that is missing (pushOfChangeFindsChangeCreatedByPreviousPushThatWasNotIndexed). In the incident that prompted this, both pushes reached ReceiveCommits 64ms apart.",
